    - **Improvement Guidance**: Investigate how expenses are summed in the `get_summary` method to ensure they are only added once and that categories are correctly managed during the summation process. Regularly reviewed logic will maintain accurate results.

By implementing these recommendations collectively, the overall quality and robustness of the expense management application can be greatly improved, ensuring a better user experience and functionality.

